{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46828","headline":"寄玉泉实仁上人 · 齐己","name":"寄玉泉实仁上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"往岁曾寻圣迹时，树边三遶礼吾师。\n敢望护法将军记，且喜焚香弟子知。\n後会未期心的的，前峯欲下步迟迟。\n今来老劣难行甚，空寂无缘但寄诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46828.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46828","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}